1 NAME Johannes /Hircinius Bock/
2 GIVN Johannes
2 SURN Hircinius Bock
1 SEX M
1 BURI
2 PLAC Rumskulla (H)
2 ADDR
1 BIRT
2 DATE ABT 1600
2 ADDR
3 CITY Vadstena
3 STAE Östergötland
3 CTRY Sverige
