2 CONT
2 CONT     * Memories and vagaries, 1897
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Letters from a mourning city, 1899
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Bref och skisser, 1909
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Red cross and iron cross, 1916
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Red Cross and Ironcross (1917)
2 CONT
2 CONT     * For those who love music, 1918
2 CONT
