1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Carl Johan von Liewen=
2 CONT
2 CONT * Son of Lt. Gen. Berndt Wilhelm von Liewen and Anna Magdalena Taube
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ==[https://www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/Von_Liewen_nr_45 Baronial House von Liewen No. 45, by Adelsvapen Geneologies]
2 CONT
2 CONT '''TABLE 24'''
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Carl Johan''' (son of Bernt Vilhelm, table 11), born 1733-07-07 Lärkesholm county. Volunteer at Kronoberg's regiment 1746-05-01. Sergeant at the Crown Prince's regiment 1750-02-28. Sergeant at first regiment s. Oh. 19/9. Staff 
2 CONC ensign first. 1752-06-23. Staff cornet at the Northern Scanian Cavalry Regiment 1753-09-27 first lieutenant. 1757-12-06. Horsemaster 1760. Resignation 1761-05-06. Commandant at Dronningskär near Karlskrona 1778-05-14. Lieutenant C
2 CONC olonel's character 11/18/1793. Died 1798-07-21 at Kungsholm's castle near the said city. Witnessed the war in Pomerania 1758 and 1759. '''Married 1st 1759-06-29 to Hedvig Tott , born 1736-08-22 at Skabersjö in the parish of the sa
2 CONC me name, Malmöhus län, died 1778-03-23 ​​in Lärka in Örkelljunga parish, daughter of master rider Otto Tott, natural. and adopt. Tott , and his 1st wife Christina Kaas. Married 2nd 1786-11-19 at Drottningskär 13 to Sibilla Sofia K
2 CONC allenberg , born 1751-11-16 in Landskrona 13 , died 1820-07-18 in Ängelholm, daughter of the councilor in Landskrona Jöns Kallenberg and Sibilla Christina Engellau.'''
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Children:'''
2 CONT
2 CONT * 1. '''Bernt Vilhelm ,''' born 1760-06-01 at Lärkesholm. Rust master at Kronoberg's regiment 1774-11-05. Page at court 1775-06-08. Chamber page 16 1778-02-12. Cornet in the army s.å. 8/9 . Ridpage 16 1779-06-07. Cornet at the Nor
2 CONC thern Scanian Cavalry Regiment 1780-06-12. Lieutenant there. 1784-12-20. Staff horseman 1791-04-24. Second Major 1804-12-20. Premier Major at Skåne Dragoons, then Hussar Regiment 1805-08-14. Lieutenant Colonel's resignation 1813-0
2 CONC 1-28. RSO 1809-07-03. Died unmarried 1825-06-30 at Turinge mill in Finja parish, Kristianstad county.
2 CONT * 1. '''Anna Christina ,''' born 1761-08-17, died p. Oh. 17/12.
2 CONT * 1. '''Charlotta Dorotea ,''' born 1763-04-05, died unmarried 07-08-1807 at Skabersjö in the parish of the same name, Malmöhus county and buried p. Oh. 24/7.
2 CONT * 1. '''Carl Fredrik ,''' born 18-06-1765, died p. Oh. 25/6.
2 CONT * 1. '''Gustaf Adam ,''' born 1766-11-04, died 1768-06-16.
2 CONT * 1. '''Tage ,''' born 1768-02-09, died 1770-10-29.
2 CONT * 1. '''Carl Johan ,''' born 1771. Captain. Died 1820. born 1771-07-23. Ship's boy 1779-12-23. Sergeant at Kalmar regiment 1787-08-19. Ensign first. 1788-10-23. Lieutenant in the army 1789-02-11. Lieutenant in the regiment 1796-04
2 CONC -20. transp. to the king's own enlisted regiment 1797-12-24. Captain first. 1802-04-07. Resignation 23-02-1813. Died 1820-04-16 Pilshult. Married 1807-05-10 in Hälsingborg to parish virgin Antoinetta Elisabet von Hauswolff , born 
2 CONC 1777-11-29 Billesholm, died 1826-09-25 in Barkåkra parish, Kristianstad county, daughter of colonel Olivier Salomon von Hauswolff , and his 1st wife Elizabeth Dorothea Francken.
2 CONT * 2. '''Bernt Malte ,''' born 1790. District Governor. Died 1869. born 1790-12-09 at Kungsholms sjökastell, Karlskrona. Student in Lund 1805. Chamber junior. Häradshövding's nhov 18 1815-01-31. Prefect of the Eastern District of J
2 CONC önköping County 1818-07-24. RNO 1864-01-28. Died 17/01/1867 in Eksjö. Married 1819-07-23 Grantinge County to Annetta Carolina Battram , born 16-11-1799, died 06-02-1782 in Eksjö, daughter of the lawman and district chief Lars Henr
2 CONC ik Battram and Hedvig Magdalena Krumlinde.
2 CONT
