2 CONT * Syskon:	Margareta Brandel, Maria Brandel, Johan Brandel, Anna Maria Brandel, Anna Rosina Brandel, Christopher Brandel, Johan Brandel, Anna Maria Brandel, Johan* Antoni Brandel, Carl* Christian Brandel, Gottfrid Brandel, Daniel B
