1 NOTE {geni:about_me} * Updated from [http://www.myheritage.com/research/collection-1/myheritage-family-trees?itemId=116254071-19-11018&action=showRecord&indId=externalindividual-ee3a67fcafca63054d3ce86882fbcb80&mrid=1799411978a5c58e772
