1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Per Eriksson I Fallebo ÖstregÅrd==
2 CONT
2 CONT * Son of Erik Emundsson
2 CONT * Farmer in Fallebo, sex man, board member, church attendant
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Married==
2 CONT
2 CONT * Married:  ''' Ingeborg Bertilsdotter Duræa''' daughter of Daughter of Bartholdus Nicolai Duræus and Elisabet Persdotter Silkelock 
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Children==
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Elisabet Karlsson (born Persdotter),'''
2 CONT * '''Sven Persson,'''
2 CONT * '''Erik Persson,'''
2 CONT * '''Samuel Persson,'''
2 CONT * '''Gösta Or Gustaf Persson,'''
2 CONT * '''Bengta Carlsson (born Persdotter),'''
2 CONT * '''Nils Persson Dahl,'''
2 CONT * '''Bertil Persson,'''
2 CONT * '''Börje Persson,'''
2 CONT
2 CONT == Notes==
2 CONT
2 CONT Homeowner in Fallebo Östregård (Fallebo no. 1), Kristdala sn. Committee man in Tunaläns herad. Boardman 1642-68, Church Warden, Sexman 1645-63. Owner Fallebo 2/3 mtl I: 4-8 and 1: 10-14.  May 1654, 28/9, on behalf of his and his s
2 CONC iblings, fixed on the eastern treasury in Fallebo. On the thing 1668 18/5 he is called "the future".
2 CONT
