2 CONT
2 CONT Emigrerade den 1888-03-21 från Tingsås till Amerika. 
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT "This is a male who left for North America 21 of march 1888. He i a "fosterson" but I belive he was a pfysiological son of Clas Johan Edvard Törnkvist. There was no extra NN NN in my opinon."
