1 CONT data was
1 CONT extracted.
1 CONT
1 CONT !NOTES:
1 CONT 1- Data extracted Sep 1993
1 CONT 2- I have found out that the name SMALAND is the name of a province
1 CONT in the center portion of Sweden which comprises the counties of
1 CONT Kalmar,
1 CONT Jonkoping, and Kronoberg. The use of this name does not point to a
1 CONT parish or
1 CONT county and the first place name is generaly a farm or village within
1 CONT the
1 CONT parish.
1 CONT 3- Kristdala is the name of a parish in Kalmar county.
