0 @N6000000002577281507@ NOTE !SOURCES:
1 CONT 1- The records of A R Anderson, Syracuse, Utah, the Ole Anderson Family
1 CONT geneaogist.
1 CONT 2- The records of Owen B Anderson, brother, from whose records this data was
1 CONT extracted.
1 CONT
1 CONT !NOTES:
1 CONT 1- Data extracted Oct 1993
1 CONT 2- I have found out that the name SMALAND is the name of a province
1 CONT in the center portion of Sweden which comprises the counties of Kalmar,
1 CONT Jonkoping, and Kronoberg. The use of this name does not point to a parish or
1 CONT county and the first place name is generaly a farm or village within the
1 CONT parish.
1 CONT 3- Kristdala is the name of a parish in Kalmar county.
1 CONT 4- The FGR that has Petrus Meurling and Fredrika Tornes as parents, has Fredrika
1 CONT as his 1st wife and Christine Catharina Kastman as 2nd wife, who died
1 CONT childless.
1 CONT !SOURCES:
1 CONT 1- The records of A R Anderson, Syracuse, Utah, the Ole Anderson Family
1 CONT geneaogist.
1 CONT 2- The records of Owen B Anderson, brother, from whose records this data was
1 CONT extracted.
1 CONT
