1 CONT 4- 28 May 1998: IGI Update.
1 CONT
1 CONT !NOTES:
1 CONT 1- Data extracted Sep 1993
1 CONT 2- I have found out that the name SMALAND is the name of a province
1 CONT in the center portion of Sweden which comprises the counties of Kalmar,
1 CONT Jonkoping, and Kronoberg. Trothult does not show up as a parish.
1 CONT 3- 1998: The address book show a village named Trälshult, Knärd, Halland.
1 CONT This is the only address I can find so far. The province of Halland is        between Smaland and the west coast of Sweden. From the looks of the map a     narrow strip of the eastern portion of Halland county could be included   
1 CONC     within the boundries of Smaland province. A Province has no administrative    or civil powers, therefore should not be used as an address where research    can be done.
1 CONT 4- The IGI update also has this birthplace listings: Kristala, Kalmar.
