1 CONT
1 CONT NOTES:
1 CONT 1- Rebecca Gustaveson Harris has the birth place as Hult, Kalmar,
1 CONT Sweden. She also adds "of Malmgrufva, Ostergotland".
1 CONT 2- Sealed to spouse date (194x) shown on A. R. Anderson records
1 CONT is difficult to read and is estimated to be 1942 .
1 CONT 3- Birth date (1695) also shown as 1696 (A. R. Anderson records).
1 CONT 4- Nov 1994: The Swedish Postal book identifies Malmgrufva as
