1 CONT
1 CONT NOTES:
1 CONT 1- Karl's first wife was Maria Mejding. Name of second wife is
1 CONT difficult to read on A. R. Anderson records.
0 @N6000000002576996134@ NOTE SOURCE:
1 CONT 1-  The compiler used the Swedish Family History book in the Family
1 CONT History Library in Salt Lake City 3 p 548.
1 CONT 2-  Dec 1994: Swedish Postal Address Book.
1 CONT 3-  6 July, 2000: Ancestral File report.
1 CONT 4-  Dec 1994: Swedish Postal Address Book.
1 CONT
1 CONT NOTES:
1 CONT 1- All of the children had a patronymic surname, Nilson, along with the          family surname Meurling. According to the rules given to the priests,         these two names should not be used at the same time.
1 CONT Inasmuch as the patrinymic name was not used in the begining, I feel
1 CONT that we should stay with the name Meurling to avoid   confusion.
