1 CONT spouse's name is Maria.
1 CONT 2- Maria Joosten is Jons' first wife (A. R. Anderson records).
1 CONT 3- 21 Jul 1993: Records of Owen B Anderson show that the name of
1 CONT this person should be Johannes Jon Meurling. This is the way he is listed     on the FGR in the records that we recieved from Dad after his death. Our
1 CONT original record from Uncle Arthur has him listed as Jon Nilsson
1 CONT Meurling with Maria Joosten as spouce and no children. On dad's record he     is listed on his parents, Nils Meurling and Margatetha Hellenstine, as        child # 5 with the name of Johannes Jon Meurling married to a Maria Gooten
1 CONC     with 4 children. There was a note on dad's records that he had 2 wives,       both from Netherlands and that he traveled extensively throughout Europe      with them. I will not enter these FGR's at this time as there is to mu
1 CONC ch
1 CONT discrepancy with them.
1 CONT 4- 1997: An IGI check lists this person's name as Jons Johannes Nilson
1 CONT Meurling, born about 1772 in Gilstad, Ostergotland, Sweden. his spouse is
1 CONT listed as Maria Tooten.
