0 @N6000000002577155478@ NOTE !SOURCES
1 CONT 1- A R Anderson records
1 CONT 2- 24 Aug 1993: Records of Owen B Anderson .
1 CONT 3-  3 December 1995: An edit of the Ancestral File update.
1 CONT
1 CONT !NOTES:
1 CONT 1- I have found out that the name SMALAND is the name of a province
1 CONT in the center portion of Sweden which comprises the counties of
1 CONT Kalmar, Jonkoping, and Kronoberg. The use of this name does not point to
1 CONT a parish or county and the first place name is generaly a farm or village
1 CONT within the parish.
1 CONT 2- Jan 1755. Maria Juliana died in 1750. According to the records she had two
1 CONT children listed to her and Jons after her death, born 1950 and 1952. The
1 CONT death date has to be investigated.
1 CONT 3- December 1995: This edit showed that Maria was born 23 Sep 1750,
1 CONT in Askryds, Jonkoping, Sweden. Child #7 was born brfore Marie died, but       child #8 would of had to have been born after she died. We have no firm       birth date in our record. There is still no children listed in the        
1 CONC     Ancestral File for this marriage.
