0 @N6000000002577213096@ NOTE !SOURCE:
1 CONT 1- April 1993: Owen B Anderson Family History.
1 CONT 2- 24 Nov 1994: TempleReady file report.
1 CONT 3- Swedish Postal Address Book.
1 CONT
1 CONT NOTES:
1 CONT 1- The Postal book lists "Torpa" as a dairy, which must be of good size to be  listed seperatly. At the time of birth the parish was named Ydre, but is now  named Torpa. There are 6 more listings of "Torpa" as farms or villages in
1 CONC  Östergotland. "Torpa" is listed more that 30 times as localities in nearly all of the counties in Sweden. As a parish, Torpa is listed in 5 counties. The more probable parish in this case would be  Östergotland.
