0 @N6000000002577169041@ NOTE SOURCE:
1 CONT 1-  Film #183574; p 415; entry 14682; IGI Ordinance Index; FamilySearch.
0 @N6000000002577175073@ NOTE SOURCE:
1 CONT 1-  Research of Ella Heckscher, Uppsula, Sweden, who was hired by Rebecca         Gustaveson Harris and her brother, David Gustaveson, children of Aunt         Hannah Gustaveson. The children also did research of their own in the 
1 CONC Los     Angeles amd Salt Lake City libraaries.
1 CONT 2-  Ancestral File (TM)
1 CONT
1 CONT NOTES:
1 CONT 1- Much of the data of the Lars Peter Holmstrom and Sophia Helene Meurling  lines were from Rebecca's and David's research and from the research of   Ella Heckscher whom they hired.
1 CONT
1 CONT 2- I have found a letter to Dad (Owen) from Rebecca with a makeshift  pedigree with dates that I will check against our records and note the  differences. The letter was dated 3 Aug 1958.
1 CONT
1 CONT 3- According to Rebecca, all of the material in the Family History  Files were put under Ole Anderson's name until 1954, after that the names  were done under her name.
1 CONT
1 CONT 4- Rebecca has Sophia born 7 Jul 1771, Hult, Kalmar, Sweden.
1 CONT
1 CONT 5- In Feb 1993 I, Bob, checked into the IGI Microfiche in the Family Search program and found 6 names of the Meurling family that have  been entered into the Temple for ordinace work, these were done so under the name       of Ole
1 CONC  Anderson as relitive. At this time I cannot  relate them to an existing family group. I will list them in a seperate file under the name Meurling for reference purposes. They all have the surname of MEURLING.       All of the ord
1 CONC inance work has been done for them. I will list  them by  thier given name and birthdate.
1 CONT Agathon Barthold    M  24 Apr 1816
1 CONT Augusta Matilda     F  26 Sep 1841               "
1 CONT Carl Edgar          M      ?                     "
1 CONT Christe Nielsen     M  abt    1734               "
1 CONT Charles John-
1 CONT Victor Algerman     M  29 Jun 1844               "
1 CONT Frans Wilhelm       M  17 Apr 1845               "
1 CONT 6- 21 Jul 1993; While entering family group records from the Owen B  Anderson    Book Of Rememberance I have found most of the above names. They were with  a group of records that were sent to Uncle Arthur from Sweden and done by 
1 CONC  the above mentioned researcher, She indicated that they  may not be part of our family line, but she sent them anyway.  Most of these families can  be found in the "Meurling" file.
1 CONT
1 CONT 7- Nov 1993: The FGR compiled by David G Harris on his grandmother's  records says that Sophia was born in Hult, Kalmar, Sweden. Hult is a  parish in  Jönköping county. This record also had some earlier ordinance records for  Soph
1 CONC ia Helena Meurling. All 3 of their children were sealed to them ,also, on 18 Aug 1944, in the Salt Lake Temple.
1 CONT
1 CONT 8- 1997: The Ancestral File has Sophia's birthplace as Hult, Kalmar,  Sweden.    Also her place of death as Hult, Kalmar, Andrarum, Sweden.  This is not  acurate as Hult is listed in the Swedish postal Address book as a parish    
1 CONC in Jönköping county and Andrarum is a parish in  Kristianstad county. I  believe the locality address we have listed is more  acurate. The ordinance work for this report was apparently done in the Idaho Falls  temple by Aunt Hanna
1 CONC h's family. It seems as though half of Sophia's siblings were born in Hult and half in Asby.
1 CONT
1 CONT 9- 24 Apr 1997: An Ancestral File search showed a Helena Sophia Meurling born abt 1775 at Dalen, Androrum, Kristianstad. Spouse of Lars Peter Holmstrom,  Sr.
0 @N6000000002577169506@ NOTE 1- 1993: Records of Owen B Anderson.
1 CONT 2- 24 April 1997: Ancestral File report.
1 CONT
1 CONT NOTES:
1 CONT 1- The name (Magaus) also spelled Magnus (A. R. Anderson records).
1 CONT 2- 1997: The Index Summary has this person's name as Mangus Göran
1 CONT Gustaf Meurling, born in Hult, Kalmar lan, Sweden. The birthdate is the
1 CONT same. This placename is entirely wrong. Hult is a parish in Jönköping lan.    The Swedish Postal Address book has no other parish named Hult listed.
0 @N6000000002577169543@ NOTE 1- Death also listed as 15 Mar 1838.
