1 CONT 2- There were two Catharina"s listed as married to Paul Gustaf Rudebeck. I have
1 CONT deleted one as it was a duplicate. The marraige date -1726- is an estimate.
1 CONT Thier first born was born in 1727.
1 CONT 3- All of the children had a patronymic surname along with the surname Meurling.
1 CONT According to the rules given to the priests, these two names should not be
1 CONT used at the same time. Inasmuch as the patrinymic name was not used in the
1 CONT begining, I feel that we should stay with the name Meurling to avoid
1 CONT confusion.
1 CONT 4- 1994: The place name of "Kraskejo" is not listed in the swedish postal book
1 CONT It may be a farmland in Kalmar county. We will need a parish name.
1 CONT
1 CONT 5- I am putting down the birth place as listed on the FGR, even though Smaland
1 CONT is a Provence with 3 counties.
1 CONT 6- Dec 1994: In the postal book "Kraksejo" is spelled "Krakejo" and is a farm
1 CONT area in Algutsdoda parish Kronoberg county. This is in Smaland province.
1 CONT !SOURCES:
1 CONT 1-  The compiler used the swedish FH book in the FH library in Salt Lake
1 CONT City 3 p 548.
1 CONT 2- 22 Jul 1993: data from the records of Owen B Anderson.
1 CONT 3- 28 Sep 1994: TempleReady File report.
1 CONT 4- Dec 1994: Swedish Postal Address Book.
1 CONT
1 CONT !NOTES:
1 CONT 1- 1994: This record also has Catherina's birthplace as Kraksjo, Kalmar, Sweden.
1 CONT The first field is probably a village name. The second field is different
1 CONT than her father's name.
1 CONT 2- There were two Catharina"s listed as married to Paul Gustaf Rudebeck. I have
1 CONT deleted one as it was a duplicate. The marraige date -1726- is an estimate.
1 CONT Thier first born was born in 1727.
1 CONT 3- All of the children had a patronymic surname along with the surname Meurling.
1 CONT According to the rules given to the priests, these two names should not be
1 CONT used at the same time. Inasmuch as the patrinymic name was not used in the
1 CONT begining, I feel that we should stay with the name Meurling to avoid
1 CONT confusion.
1 CONT 4- 1994: The place name of "Kraskejo" is not listed in the swedish postal book
1 CONT It may be a farmland in Kalmar county. We will need a parish name.
1 CONT
1 CONT 5- I am putting down the birth place as listed on the FGR, even though Smaland
1 CONT is a Provence with 3 counties.
1 CONT 6- Dec 1994: In the postal book "Kraksejo" is spelled "Krakejo" and is a farm
1 CONT area in Algutsdoda parish Kronoberg county. This is in Smaland province.
