1 CONT 1- 1993: The above records has the birthplace as Morlunda, Kalmar, Sw.
1 CONT 2- The recognized list of parishes and counties has the parish of Morlanda
1 CONT in Goteborg och Bohus county, which is on the southwestern coast.
