0 @N6000000002577182794@ NOTE NOTES:
1 CONT 1- Sept 1999: My uncle, Arthur R. Anderson's daughter sent me come family        group records that he had prepared from records sent to him about 40 years    ago from a genealogist in Uppsala, Sweden named Ella Herckscher. The   
1 CONC        Anderson family had hired her from time to time to research some of our       family lines for us.
1 CONT
1 CONT Some of the names we were not able to fit into our lines at that time.        This family is one of them. I will keep it in my father's file until we       are able to find out where it goes. It probably belongs to some of the    
1 CONC     Meurling families that Ella sent to him as a bonus to see if we could use     them.  Even though we are not able to fit them into our lines, Uncle          Arthur had the temple ordinance work done for them anyway.
