0 @N6000000002577155005@ NOTE !SOURCES:
1 CONT 1-A.R.Anderson, Sryacuse, Davis, Utah
1 CONT 2- October 1993: Owen B Anderson book of Remembrance, Pleasant Grove
1 CONT Utah,Utah
1 CONT 3- 28 Sep 1994: TempleReady file report.
1 CONT
1 CONT !NOTES:
1 CONT 1- Hedvig was a widow. Our records had her as being married to Nils
1 CONT Meurling 29 Sep 1747. This was before Nils was born.
1 CONT 2- 22 Jul 1993: There was some added data on the FGR of Owen B
1 CONT Anderson that shows that she was born 14 Sep 1747, and married Nils after     she was widowed. She was the widow of a man named KIHLSTEDT
1 CONT 3- Dec 1993: The computer brought up a records problem that Hedvig
1 CONT was "0" years old when she was married. She was born in 1747 and married      in 1747. The latter date had to be wrong. She was a widow when she married    Nils Meurling. Her son Barthold was born in 1784, so I estimated Hedvig's
1 CONT marriage date as 1783 to clear up this problem.
1 CONT 4- 1994: The place name "Toby" is not listed in the Swedish Postal
1 CONT book. There is a "Toba" listed as a farm place in Nykill.parish,              Ostergotland, Sweden.
0 @N6000000002577166638@ NOTE !SOURCES:
