1 CONT 3- 1994: There are two files on Barthold Meurling. An earlier file has him       born in Hagerstad, Sodermanland, Sweden. This record has him born in          Hagerstad, Ostergotland, Sweden. Hagerstad parish is in Ostergotland, s
1 CONC o      we will merge  RIN 5646 into 5674.
1 CONT 4- Family record # 5646 had a birth yeay of 1780.
