1 CONT NOTES:
1 CONT 1- 1994: I believe that Jons's birthdate should be 5 Sep 1823. The date listed
1 CONT on the record, now, has him being born 3 months after his sister Emerentia.
1 CONT This may be a typo on our part, because the rin puts her as the last child
1 CONT born , which is more locical.
